  noteTitle: Dusty Note
  noteItemModel: {fileID: 3164688655149136121, guid: 8afb0c280bcbdca42bd4c61cbec40813,
    type: 3}
  notePages:
  - In an attempt to try to help the current situation. I decided to completely lock
    down the lower levels.
  - The stairway is already blocked so the only way up is the <b>Boiler Room</b>
    emergency ladderway.
  - So if you are <b>alive</b> and reading this, that is the only way out to the
    higher floors.
  - First you need to get into Lower Administration. It's just the last door down
    this hallway and to the left. I locked the door so first grab the key from the
    <b>Boiler Workshop.</b>
  - You need the Boiler Control Key, I put it in <b>Joan's Office</b>. You're going
    to need it to enter the <b>Boiler Control Room</b> to lift the emergency lockdown.
  - May God help us all.
  - '- Jackson'
